  "description": "Per-session activity (cost, turns, LLM calls, artifacts), turn complexity mix over time, turn classification detail, and artifact detail -- all Postgres-native (api_costs, route_traces, artifacts), replacing the Elasticsearch rebuild-from-Kibana version. FRE-1211.",
