      },
      "description": "Per-session rollup keyed on session_id: SUM(cost_usd)/COUNT(*) from api_costs, COUNT(DISTINCT trace_id)/AVG(latency_total_ms) from route_traces, COUNT(*) from artifacts. FULL OUTER JOIN across the three (not through sessions -- grafana_ro is deliberately not granted SELECT on sessions, which carries raw conversation content). Top 15 sessions by total cost, last 90 days. FRE-1211 rebuild onto Postgres.",
